// Provider gating. When true, match discovery/results use AllSports (footapi7) only.
// Re-enabled Football-Data (2026-06-30) because the footapi7 RapidAPI quota was
// exhausted, leaving the single-provider setup with no fallback (no results, no
// future fixtures). With this false, refreshToday fetches BOTH Football-Data
// (WC/EC in national mode; club leagues in club mode) and AllSports, then dedupes.
//
// Back to AllSports-only (2026-08-11): the RapidAPI account was reissued with a
// 15000/day plan, so quota is no longer the constraint that forced FD back on.
// Two consequences to remember before flipping this back:
//   - Copa Libertadores (CLI) has no id in FOOTAPI_TOURNAMENT_IDS, so it is not
//     discovered at all while this is true.
//   - getCandidates hides stored rows whose api_provider isn't AllSports and that
//     have no source_id, so already-ingested FD rows must be re-fetched (admin
//     SAFE refresh per day) or they disappear from the admin candidate list.
const TEMP_ALLSPORTS_ONLY_PROVIDER = true;



